      },
      {
       "id": "2089:28284",
       "name": "At Renit, we value the privacy of our users and are committed to protecting their Personal Information. Renit’s Privacy Policy (“Policy”) outlines how Renit Classifieds LLP, a company incorporated under the laws of India, having its registered office at 6-GA-6, Sector 11 Hiran Magri, Udaipur City, Girwa, Rajasthan - 313001 (“we” / “us” / “our” / “Renit”) collects, uses, discloses, processes, transfers, stores and protects the information gathered from users of our websites (the \"simplyrenit.com\", \"renit.co.in\") or our application or other platforms and services that we offer (collectively, “Platform”). We are committed to safeguarding the privacy and security of information supplied by every person accessing or using our Platform (“you” or “user”). By accessing or using our Platform, you acknowledge that you have read and understood the Policy and you agree to the practices described in this Policy.",
       "type": "TEXT",
